<title>UK: Citibank sets warrants on Valora Holding.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on Valora Holding.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank NA New York has issued four million American-style call warrants, on Valora Holdings, lead manager Citibank Switzerland said.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    350.00 CHF		PREMIUM	18.25 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     3.55 CHF		  GEARING	=</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   14.AUG.98		 PAYDATE	13.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   =			   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  326.00 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
